{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KMbAW8ZHtS1795762201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「長腳蟹」呂慧儀（阿蟹）於 2006 年參加《香港小姐競選》奪得季軍入行，轉眼間已加入 TVB 整整 20 個年頭！昨日（26 日）TVB 舉行《長期服務暨傑出員工榮譽大獎頒獎典禮 2026》，阿蟹正式獲頒「20 年長期服務金牌」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974489227861681_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kaaCXJzyU81795762200.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>適逢昨日是感恩節，令這個里程碑別具意義，她在社交網晒出多張捧著金牌的靚相，並感性發長文感謝多年來提攜她的三位重要高層與伯樂：「今日感恩節非常感恩❤️有照顧我 20 年的樂小姐，有成就了熊若水的珍姐，有塑造『長腳蟹』的文總監，能在這公司的成長旅途上有他們，是多麼的幸運。❤️」</p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974458038877615_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jJOjYinZsg1795762199.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974457434968031_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zBYiTxZ8Gr1795762200.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974459087590722_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026buMoVcM3OQ1795762200.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>回望入行 20 年的點滴，阿蟹坦言一路走來有不少得著，有笑亦有淚：「可以嘗試的機會有很多，認識的同事和朋友很多，團隊中一起打拼的很多，歡笑有很多，眼淚有很多，汗水有很多，愛護也有很多。」她續以幽默又正能量的語氣自我勉勵：「在這很多很多的滋養下，讓我也成長了很多，終於拿得起這重重的金牌，讓我以後繼續鍛鍊鍛鍊，手瓜起𦟌再拿下更重的。❤️ #20年金牌 #不經不覺 #回頭看看 #實在感恩 #呂慧儀」</p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974459691503019_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NCjGFoLwkv1795762199.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"konniecrab_1795704028_4038974459800492492_4705335194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026b61EI0zn2n1795762201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 下午12.07.24.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cGebzfT1bA1795762324.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>除了公司頒發的榮譽外，一班長情粉絲亦相當有心，特別送上厚達至少 5 頁紙的心意長信祝賀她入行 20 周年，令阿蟹大為感動！不少網民及《愛．回家之開心速遞》劇迷亦紛紛留言祝賀，大讚她多年來敬業樂業，期待她繼續帶來更多精彩演出。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:23:55.546408+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":566,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:40.949276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:16.448919+00:00","content_hash":"d7c2301bc1d331beabd743b9e08580f28c025c25c12a7b1fd5e0cc87319b0ed4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:23:55.546408+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}